You should never pray unless that is the last option left for you.
The first prayer can be done after 300 moves. After that how much you
have to wait depends on RNG. It can be as low as 35 and as high as 3500
moves (For high level characters it can be even higher, and that is
without
crowning, after crowning for an XL30 character it can be as high as
27000 moves).
So do not pray after the first prayer unless you know that you can
safely pray.

Also a successful prayer may not always solve your problems,
it depends on your luck and alignment. If your luck is negative or
your alignment is not greater than 0 then there is a 50% chance that
your god may not solve your problem. For roles caveman, priest,
tourist,
valkyrie, and wizard the alignment is set to 0 in the beginning.
So you cannot be sure of getting a benefit in the first prayer unless
you have
raised your alignment beyond the 0 for these roles. So kill something
first,
or if lawful or healer heal your pet.

